    "description": "An open-source, modular pipeline for automatic, explainable video quality auditing. Assesses AI-generated and natural videos across 21 native modules covering intra-shot metrics (motion coherence, SSIM, flicker, identity consistency), inter-shot coherence (structure, style, semantics), and narrative flow. Produces outputs compatible with VBench, VideoScore, DOVER, and FAST-VQA leaderboards.",
